The 39-page review baseline :codex-file-citation{path="[redacted]" purpose="output"} compiled without errors or warnings; all pages were visually checked. [PR #54](https://github.com/asalzburger/nodd/pull/54) has passed CI.

Remaining coverage, thermal, mechanical and service-packing questions are explicit for review.

